T*
(Player text) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The home lowers, and from it steps a being seven feet tall: part humanoid, part firefly,) Tj
T*
(moving in slow drifts broken by sudden jerky motions. Her face is hard to read, but her) Tj
T*
(voice carries every feeling plainly. She eyes your group with open mischief. "Are you) Tj
T*
(the group Emeris sent from the capital? Oh my. You are rather late, are you not? Come) Tj
T*
(in, come in." Inside, the treehouse opens far larger than it should, packed with potion) Tj
T*
(bottles, spellbooks, runes, plants, and small creatures. None of it is messy. You get) Tj
T*
(the sense that if you moved a single item an inch, she would know.) Tj
